1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 23=

17
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,470
I showed up at just the right time.

18
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,830
When he grabbed your hand,

19
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,470
your ears were bright red.

20
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,750
Keep your eyes on the road.

21
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,990
Your younger guy's a hotshot CEO now,

22
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,310
and he's still crazy about you.

23
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,870
So what's holding you back?

24
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,430
I heard that these past few years,

25
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,550
he's been working day and night.

26
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,630
Through overseas markets,

27
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,070
his stake is almost
catching up to Ji Sinian's.

28
00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,670
Yeah, I heard.

29
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,150
But

30
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:03,230
I have Tangtang. That's enough.

31
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,630
Of course Tangtang's adorable.

32
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,710
You learned to cook for her.

33
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,310
You quit smoking and drinking.

34
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,510
You're so careful now you won't
even get on a plane.

35
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,870
Good thing I was there when you
adopted her,

36
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:17,150
or I'd swear you gave birth to her
yourself.

37
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,750
She showed me what it feels like

38
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,750
to have someone rely on me

39
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,670
and trust me completely.

40
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,110
It's wonderful.

41
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,590
So,

42
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,350
I will never

43
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,790
let her grow up

44
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,550
without a mother.

45
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,750
That has nothing to do with dating.

46
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:37,190
Tangtang needs a dad.

47
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,190
And you need a man.

48
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,390
I don't.

49
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,230
Do you not trust men,

50
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,870
or are you just

51
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,390
afraid Cheng Lin will let you down?

52
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,470
Five years ago,

53
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,550
Tangtang came into your life

54
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,390
just as Cheng Lin left.

55
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,870
You haven't dated in five years.

56
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,470
Don't tell me
it's not because of Cheng Lin.

57
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,350
Su Yan.

58
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,510
Take a chance.

59
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,670
Did you have fun?

60
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:18,670
Yeah!

61
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:25,750
What are you doing here?

62
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,270
I'm here to win over

63
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,550
your daughter.

64
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,190
Tangtang.

65
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,470
I'm your mom's friend.

66
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,710
Want to be friends?

67
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,870
Hi, mister!

68
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:54,470
Tangtang.

69
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,910
Call him Mr. Cheng.

70
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,470
Tangtang.

71
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:10,150
Want me to be your dad?

72
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,750
Cheng Lin!

73
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,470
So you're Cheng Lin.

74
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,550
You know me?

75
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:20,950
Mom says your name in her sleep.

76
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:22,870
Tangtang!

77
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,510
Looks like your mom

78
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,630
thinks about me a lot.

79
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,670
Check your seat belts again.

80
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,150
Keep Tangtang safe.

81
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:54,590
What's wrong?

82
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,070
Someone tampered with the brakes.

83
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,870
Fengqi Road is just ahead.

84
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,990
We'll hit the East Ring Road
in about half an hour.

85
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,150
Hello?

86
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,870
Someone tampered with our brakes.

87
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,230
(Fengqi Road)
Set up roadblocks on East Ring Road.

88
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:14,990
As soon as possible.

89
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:15,750
(Okay.)

90
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:17,750
(Keep your speed steady. Stay calm.)

91
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,190
Mom, what's wrong?

92
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,150
It's okay, sweetie.

93
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:22,510
Try to get some sleep.

94
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,850
I'll wake you up later, okay?

95
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,710
(Traffic police are in position.)

96
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,550
(Barriers ahead in five minutes.)

97
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,470
(Stay calm.)

98
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,350
Mom!

99
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,510
Cheng Lin!

100
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:01,670
Cheng Lin!

101
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,030
Cheng Lin!

102
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:04,790
Cheng Lin!

103
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,950
Cheng Lin!

104
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:09,740
(Su Yan.)

105
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:11,940
(Tell me.)

106
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:14,360
(What would make you feel better?)

107
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:17,820
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

108
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:21,340
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

109
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:24,860
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

110
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:28,620
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

111
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:47,100
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

112
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:50,740
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

113
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:53,940
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

114
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:57,620
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

115
00:05:57,620 --> 00:06:01,020
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

116
00:06:01,020 --> 00:06:04,700
♪I hum this song alone♪

117
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:08,540
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

118
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:12,620
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

119
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:15,900
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

120
00:06:15,900 --> 00:06:19,500
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

121
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:22,980
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

122
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:27,860
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
